            "value": "框選要閱讀的區域 · 按 Esc 或按右鍵取消\nWindows OCR 在本機執行，不會將螢幕像素傳送給模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Lingrove in a compatible editor. If that editor runs as an administrator, Lingrove may need the same privilege level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Lingrove in a compatible editor. If that editor runs as an administrator, Lingrove may need the same privilege level."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在兼容的编辑器中使用 Lingrove。若编辑器以管理员身份运行，Lingrove 可能也需要相同权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在相容的編輯器中使用 Lingrove。若編輯器以系統管理員身分執行，Lingrove 可能也需要相同權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text stays local unless you explicitly configure and use an endpoint.": {
